1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,225
Anthropic cut retrieval failures by
two-thirds by stacking three changes.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:11,150
The top-20 retrieval failure
rate started at 5.7%.

3
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:15,750
Contextual embeddings took it to 3.7%.

4
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:22,400
Adding contextual BM25, a keyword
index, took it to 2.9%.

5
00:00:23,017 --> 00:00:26,642
And reranking on top brought it to 1.9%.

6
00:00:26,942 --> 00:00:29,867
That's 67% fewer failures.

7
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:35,267
The reranker took the top 150 fused
candidates down to 20.

8
00:00:36,283 --> 00:00:42,446
The keyword index added gains on top of
embeddings, so don't drop BM25 just because

9
00:00:42,446 --> 00:00:43,708
you have vectors.

10
00:00:44,717 --> 00:00:47,342
The full article is on vidyal.ai.
